  Add-ons are built with Apps Script, a server-side JavaScript
  platform that requires zero setup.

That's not going to work until Emscripten can cross-compile Stan.

  Because Apps Script can connect to external APIs, it's simple
  to integrate your company's services with Google Apps.

That would work if we had that protocol buffer interface
and someone was willing to deal with managing a cloud of
Stan servers and someone else was willing to pay for it.

