Bob,
Apparently the google sheets can already run regressions so it seems that they can do some computation for free.  So if someone could get some Stan models running on google sheets, perhaps Google could run them on the same computers it’s using to run its regressions.
I’m not talking about full CloudStan here, just some preprogrammed Stan models that would do particular things such as fit mixture models or regularized regressions.
A

