The O() is great, but the devil's in the memory locality.
That can lend a real factor of 10 or more speedup.

Now if someone wants to profile autograd vs. Stan...

The real trick is that we can avoid having to do a Cholesky
decomposition in most cases (the notable exception being the
GP covariance matrix).

- Bob

